      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 260,
      "init": {
        "label": "Standoffs",
        "body": "# Keep things apart\nThe pale bar under the cables links Sensor B to the Monitoring group: a **Standoff**. Drags, tidies, and group expansion keep the two between its min and max distance; the bar slants to show slack. Make one: select exactly two items → right-click → **Link with Standoff**.",
        "color": "pink",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 240,
        "collapsed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-units",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -360,
      "y": 560,
      "init": {
        "label": "Units",
        "body": "# Units travel with the value\n**Convert** turns miles into kilometres, and from there the *value itself* carries km. The Display and its docked **Format** controller pick the unit up and lock to it: you can re-format the number but never mislabel the unit. Convert is the authority in any chain of formats.",
        "color": "vermilion",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 240,
        "collapsed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "in-trip",
